## arm 3 · git grove set --platform aws.ec2 (refused)
✋ ConstraintError: --platform 'aws.ec2' is not a platform a box declares
   want: hetzner.hetzbot (ec2 answers from its hardware; a laptop declares none)

## arm 3 · git grove --help
git grove - manage groves (machines that hold trees)

usage: git grove <command> [options]

commands:
  set <name> --at <user@host:port>  register a grove (its wake writes the ssh alias)
  set <name> --alias <ssh-alias>    register a grove on an EXTANT ssh alias
  set <name> --exid <tag> --env <e> register a cloud grove, found by tag
  wake <name>                       resume the box + open its duct
  stop <name>                       hibernate the box
  list                              list registered groves, and their drift from the tailnet
  sync [--mode plan|apply]          register each new hetzner grove the tailnet holds
  get <name>                        show one grove
  del <name>                        unregister a grove
  del --orphaned [--mode apply]     unregister every grove whose instance is gone
  send <name> --what "<cmd>"        run a command in the grove's duct
  read <name>                       read the grove's duct output

## arm 3 · git grove set --help
usage: git grove set <name> [--at <user@host:port>] [--alias <ssh-alias>]
                            [--exid <tag>] [--env <env>] [--account <id>] [--nat <exid>]
                            [--org <keyrack-org>] [--platform hetzner.hetzbot]

  ⚠️ every flag is a FIELD-LEVEL upsert: a flag given overwrites its own
     field, a flag absent KEEPS what the entry holds, and `--nat ''` clears
     one (`gotcha.a-partial-write-discards-what-it-never-read`)

## arm 3 · git grove set --platform hetzner.hetzbot --at localhost (refused)
✋ ConstraintError: grove 'grove-fixture-hetzner-loop' declares --platform hetzner.hetzbot with a loopback host 'localhost'
   ⇒ a hetzner box answers on the tailnet; a loopback or absent host routes it as an ec2 tunnel
   fix: git grove set grove-fixture-hetzner-loop --at <user>@<tailnet host>:22 --platform hetzner.hetzbot

