## arm 1 · wake, the box refuses this laptop's key
🐢 heres the wave...

🌳 git.grove.wake grove-fixture-hetzner --mode apply
   ├─ reach: the tailnet (camper@grove-fixture-hetzner-1:22) — no aws, no tunnel
   ├─ alias: grove-fixture-hetzner
   ├─ ssh  [KEEP] alias 'grove-fixture-hetzner' → camper@grove-fixture-hetzner-1:22 (the registry's seat, read first)
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: 'grove-fixture-hetzner' answered, and refused this laptop's key

  ssh said:
    camper@grove-fixture-hetzner-1: Permission denied (publickey).
  ⇒ the tailnet holds and the box is up: camper@grove-fixture-hetzner-1 does not list this key
    (<fix>/home/.ssh/id_ed25519) in its authorized_keys
  fix: a laptop that already reaches 'grove-fixture-hetzner.ground' places this one's PUBLIC key on
    every seat — on that laptop, with this laptop's .pub copied to it:
    rhx git.grove.auth.ssh.set grove-fixture-hetzner --identity <this laptop's key>.pub --mode plan
    rhx git.grove.auth.ssh.set grove-fixture-hetzner --identity <this laptop's key>.pub --mode apply

